# Global UX qoidalari

## API loading = Skeleton (majburiy)

- Ma’lumot kelgunicha **skeleton** ko‘rsatiladi (progress bar / “Yuklanmoqda…” matn emas).
- Asosiy: `Skeleton`, `SkeletonLines`, `SkeletonCard` (`components/ui/Skeleton.tsx`).
- Tayyor shablonlar: `DashboardProfileSkeleton`, `StatusCardSkeleton`, `ListPageSkeleton`.
- Har yangi API/query UI da: `isLoading` → mos skeleton; data kelgach kontent.
- HTTP faqat `apiClient` / `apiClientV2` orqali.

## Shared UI (majburiy)

- Tugma, pagination, empty, badge, panel, table, search — faqat `components/ui`.
- Select/filter: `Select`
- Batafsil: `.cursor/rules/shared-ui.mdc`.

## Scroll (majburiy)

- Scroll stili **global** (`globals.css` — `*` scrollbar).
- Yangi scrollable blokda maxsus scrollbar CSS yozilmasin.
- Kerak bo‘lsa faqat `overflow-y-auto` / `overflow-auto`.

## Chop etish (majburiy)

- Chop etish faqat `printElement` (`src/lib/printElement.ts`). `window.print()` taqiqlanadi — brauzer URL/sana chiqaradi.
- `@page { margin: 0 }` — domen va sana chiqmasin. Chet uchun `body` padding. `@page` ga margin bermang.
